  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Norges Speiderforbund - Multiannual agreement 2021-2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity building of The Zambia Scout Association (ZSA) and The Girl Guide Association of Zambia (GGAZ). The expected effect on society is that the two organisations (ZSA and GGAZ) strengthen their capacity so that they can be attractive associations, reference for other organisations, institutions and potential partners and enable them to meet societal challenges in the best way and positively affect the Zambian society (impact).</narrative>
  </description>
